# Salt & Sage Restaurant — AI Culinary Concierge & WhatsApp Automation

An AI-powered restaurant customer service and automation system designed to streamline menu inquiries, table reservations, food ordering, and customer support through a web chat interface and WhatsApp.

The system combines conversational AI, document-based knowledge retrieval, backend API development, and Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) workflows to deliver context-aware responses and support escalation to human staff.

**Tech Stack:** Node.js · Express.js · Google Gemini · LangChain · WhatsApp Cloud API · JavaScript · REST APIs

## Overview

Salt & Sage is an AI restaurant concierge that helps customers access restaurant information, place orders, and request table reservations through natural conversation. It uses a document-based knowledge source to answer restaurant-related questions and supports human intervention when AI assistance is required.

The project demonstrates practical applications of generative AI, information retrieval, API integration, and workflow automation in a restaurant customer service environment.

## Key Features

- **Document-Based Knowledge Retrieval:** Uses restaurant information to answer questions about menu items, prices, opening hours, and restaurant policies.
- **Conversational AI Assistant:** Integrates Google Gemini with LangChain to process customer messages and generate context-aware responses.
- **Automated Reservations and Orders:** Collects customer details, reservation preferences, order information, and delivery details where supported.
- **Reference ID Generation:** Generates unique reference IDs to identify orders and reservations.
- **WhatsApp Integration:** Connects the assistant to the Meta WhatsApp Cloud API to receive and respond to customer messages.
- **Human-in-the-Loop Support:** Allows customers to request human assistance and supports the transition from AI responses to staff handling.
- **AI Mode Switching:** Supports `/human`, `/ai`, and `/bot` commands according to the implemented conversation workflow.
- **Manager Notifications:** Supports WhatsApp notifications for new orders and reservations when configured.
- **Web Chat Interface:** Provides a browser-based interface for interacting with and testing the assistant.

## System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Salt & Sage Knowledge Document] --> B[Document Processing and Retrieval]
    B --> C[Knowledge Retrieval Workflow]
    D[Customer Web Chat] --> E[Express.js Backend]
    F[WhatsApp Customer] --> G[Meta WhatsApp Webhook]
    G --> E
    E --> C
    C --> H[Google Gemini Model]
    H --> I[Context-Aware Response]
    I --> E
    E --> J[Web Chat or WhatsApp Response]
    E --> K[Order and Reservation Workflow]
    K --> L[Manager WhatsApp Notification]
    E --> M[Human Support Handoff]
```

